+ nesnd_civic_characters.101.d: "The questions raised by Giovanni Valdieri have entered local organisations and public business. The advocate can still participate, while practical decisions depend on actual budgets, schools and industry."
+ nesnd_civic_characters.101.organisation: "The original advocate is no longer active in public life here. Local organisations and people in workshops and schools continue the dispute. A departure does not itself resolve the question."
+ nesnd_civic_characters.101.a: "The work must continue."
