+ nesnd_civic_characters.9.d: "Bayantu brings herders affected by construction into local talks. He asks for livestock passage and seasonal routes, or compensation for lost pasture. This meeting cannot speak for peoples elsewhere."
+ nesnd_civic_characters.9.a: "Endorse the public proposal."
