+ nesnd_small_request_market_tt:0 "Request the native market-autonomy pact from the actual market owner. Verify real ownership; if the pact exists but the market has not recalculated, allow at most 30 days."
+ nesnd_small_defence_fra:0 "Discuss Defence with $FRA$"
